  "text": "Ada Lovelace collaborated with Charles Babbage on the Analytical Engine in London. In 1843, she published the first algorithm designed to be processed by a machine. Years later, Margaret Hamilton served as director of software engineering at MIT, leading the team that developed the on-board Apollo flight guidance systems. Katherine Johnson calculated orbital trajectories at NASA for astronaut John Glenn during the Friendship 7 space mission.\n",
